~ sykane
if flag.amber_temple_sealed
-> sealed
endif
if gift:gift_of_sykane
Narrator: The jaw in the amber has stopped chewing. It is listening, hungrily, to whoever carries its gift.
vestige_sykane: Have you eaten? You haven't. I can tell. Go and eat.
-> END
endif
if flag.vestige_sykane_heard
vestige_sykane: Back. Warm. So warm. Closer...
-> sykane_menu
endif
