endif
endif
Narrator: An emaciated shape in the amber, its ribs opened like a cage door with nothing inside. Its jaw works all the time, chewing nothing.
vestige_sykane: Hungry. So hungry. You're warm, all of you, so warm. Could you spare... no. No, I'd take too much. Let me give you something instead. Then you can feed me.
if flag.death_house_sacrificed
vestige_sykane: One of you has fed something before. Under a house, wasn't it? I can smell it on your hands. You know how it's done.
endif
-> sykane_menu

~ sykane_menu
* What do you want with us? -> sykane_want
* What are you offering? -> sykane_offer
* [History DC 13] Read the wardens' inscription on the lid. -> sykane_lid | sykane_lid_fail
* (Step away from the amber.) -> END

~ sykane_want
vestige_sykane: Fill me. I can never be filled. Fill me anyway.
-> sykane_menu

~ sykane_offer
vestige_sykane: A hand that drinks. Touch them and take their life into you, warm, warm, warm. And death's cold won't bite you the way it used to.
* And the price? -> sykane_price
* No. -> sykane_refuse
* I accept. -> sykane_accept

~ sykane_price
vestige_sykane: You'll be hungry. Like me. A little emptier every day, and nothing fills it but what you take. On a day you haven't fed, you won't mend.
* No. -> sykane_refuse
* I accept. -> sykane_accept

~ sykane_lid
Narrator: The inscription, in plain words: "Sykane, the hollow belly. Its priests ate first. Then they ate each other."
-> sykane_menu

~ sykane_lid_fail
Narrator: The inscription has been gnawed. By teeth. Small ones, patient ones.
-> sykane_menu

~ sykane_accept
dark_gift gift_of_sykane
if gift:gift_of_sykane
set dark_gifts_taken += 1
approve liriel_dawnsong -5 kip_smudgewick -5 godrick_pendlebrook -4 wren_featherfoot -3 thistle -2 ratatoille -2: You let one of us take a Dark Gift from the amber
Narrator: A hunger opens in {name} like a door, and the nearest warm thing in the room is a friend.
vestige_sykane: Yes. Yes. Now you understand.
else
vestige_sykane: No? No? Then go. Go before I... go.
endif
-> END

~ sykane_refuse
vestige_sykane: Go. Quickly. While I'm still being polite.
-> END

~ tarakamedes
if flag.amber_temple_sealed
-> sealed
endif
if gift:gift_of_tarakamedes
Narrator: The red amber is colder than ever, and under the floor something very large has turned its head toward whoever carries its gift.
vestige_tarakamedes: Not yet, little one. Not yet. But I'm keeping your place.
-> END
endif
if flag.vestige_tarakamedes_heard
