vestige_tenebrous: Shh. Don't light anything. Light is so loud. Come into the dark with me. It's quiet here. It's always quiet here.
-> tenebrous_menu

~ tenebrous_menu
* What do you want with us? -> tenebrous_want
* What are you offering? -> tenebrous_offer
* [History DC 13] Read the wardens' inscription on the lid. -> tenebrous_lid | tenebrous_lid_fail
