Narrator: When {name} steps back from the amber, their shadow follows a moment late, as if it had to be persuaded.
vestige_tenebrous: Shh. There. Isn't that better?
else
vestige_tenebrous: Shh. No one. Then go back to your noise.
endif
-> END

~ tenebrous_refuse
